{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26157","headline":"履春冰 · 张萧远","name":"履春冰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一步一愁新，轻轻恐陷人。\n薄光全透日，残影半销春。\n蝉想行时翼，鱼惊蹋处鳞。\n底虚难驻足，岸阔怯回身。\n岂暇踟蹰久，宁辞顾盼频。\n愿将兢慎意，从此赴通津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张萧远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26157.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26157","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}